message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CareerShield: AI-exposure-aware career transition advice for Malaysian workers"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Moz700/CareerShield"
abstract: "Pipeline, interactive demo and evaluation code for CareerShield, a career-transition recommender that combines three published generative-AI exposure indices, transfers them to Malaysian occupations and recommends realistic lower-exposure destinations with reskilling routes. Includes the code that evaluates the recommender on observed AI applicability and post-ChatGPT employment and wage outcomes, and the capacity-capped redesign (v2)."
keywords:
  - AI exposure
  - career transitions
  - recommender systems
  - labour market
  - Malaysia
